        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-01T06:09:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just to add, I don’t think they’re giving out any promo cards with purchase either (they used to give them out for free at conventions). This time, you have to work <em>really</em> hard to earn those promos. This means sitting down and playing and winning and having a good time. Man, that’s hard work.</p>",
