        "raw": "Ok - just wondering, I guess I'll have to wait and see. I like those kind of deals when I'm new to a game and have not yet bought anything. It gives me an excuse to buy it all up front instead of just trying the base set first. I know - I'm rationalizing :-)\n\nMy wife also accepts this justification to buy a whole set of something, I bought everything Gary Games (Ascension) was selling last year using this argument :-)",
